  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut red onion into thick wedges.\n• Cut beetroot into small chunks.\n• Cut carrot into bite-sized chunks.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• To a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ebc0be8e45e3ca008632c7-a9c5c49d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: Beetroot retains a lot of its firmness when cooked. You can tell it's cooked when you can easily pierce it with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ebc0be8e45e3ca008632c7-f5d1a191.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the veggies are roasting, in a medium saucepan, melt the butter over medium-high heat.\n• Add chermoula spice blend and cook until fragrant, 30 seconds. Add the water and couscous and stir to combine.\n• Cover with a lid and remove from heat. Set aside until all the water has been absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ebc0be8e45e3ca008632c7-26997760.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop tomato.\n• Zest lemon to get a pinch, then cut into wedges.\n• To saucepan with the couscous, add tomato, baby spinach leaves and lemon zest, stirring to combine.\n• In a small bowl, combine Greek-style yoghurt and golden goddess dressing. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ebc0be8e45e3ca008632c7-4d55f7c2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the roast veggies have 5 minutes remaining, drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm thick slices.\n• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook haloumi, in batches, until golden brown, 2 minutes on each side.\n• In the last minute of cook time, add garlic and the honey, gently turning the haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ebc0be8e45e3ca008632c7-92d940b4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Moroccan-spiced couscous between bowls.\n• Top with glazed haloumi and roasted veggies.\n• Drizzle with the yoghurt dressing and tear over mint.\n• Serve with lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66ebc0be8e45e3ca008632c7-7b8dbaa9.jpeg"
    }
  ]
